{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act50side_level_act50side_04_end","storyGroup":"act50side","storySort":9,"storyDependence":"act50side_level_act50side_04_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TD-4","storyName":"赤雪之兆","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"宝巫迦面临危险，危急时刻，梓兰和空爆赶到，消灭复活的熔火蜗。“试炼”结束，宝巫迦启动“御轮”送两人回家，然而，异变陡生......","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act50side/level_act50side_04_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act50side_04","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":7,"next":9,"characters":["宝巫迦","空爆","梓兰","月见夜","月见夜&宝巫迦","政宗","武士"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":9},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":10},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"唔......","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"为什么，吾的身体到底怎么了——","id":16},{"type":"dialog","id":17},{"type":"charslot","id":18},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#9$2","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":21},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"交给我吧！","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"空爆？！","id":25},{"type":"dialog","id":26},{"type":"charslot","id":27},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_arrow_skyattack","volume":"1","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":29},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_arrow_attack","volume":"1","id":30},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_hit","volume":"1","id":31},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":32},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":33},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":34},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":36},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":37},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$exciting_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_exciting02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":38,"musicid":1},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"空爆，别分神！","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"我知道！","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"梓兰小姐，你们——","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"嘿嘿，看来我们来得还算及时！","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"宝巫迦，你的身体怎么了？","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾......不知道，只是，吾能感觉到，有一股无比邪恶的能量在牵引着吾的身体......","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"放心吧，这里交给你空爆姐姐就好了！","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"这家伙看来就是真正的“异兽”了。只要解决掉这家伙就能回家了对吧？","id":53},{"type":"dialog","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":56},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，掩护我！","id":60},{"type":"dialog","id":61},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":62},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":63},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":64},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":65},{"type":"dialog","id":66},{"type":"text","text":"超高输出属性解放斩，刚听到这个名字的时候，空爆就觉得很威风，她很喜欢。","id":67},{"type":"text","text":"当然，她更喜欢这一招的意图，利用斧头击打地面，然后顺着那股力量，借由翔虫高高跃起，挥出斧头！","id":68},{"type":"text","text":"先确认强属性瓶的充能状况，没问题，充能。盾上的红光闪烁，像是在催促她一样。","id":69},{"type":"text","text":"观察猎物——熔火蜗因为刚才的防御而出现了破绽，绝妙的机会。","id":70},{"type":"dialog","id":71},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":72},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_xiangchong","volume":"1","id":73},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_xiangchong","x":"100","y":"-200","rox":"30","roy":"20","roz":"90","layer":"2","id":74},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":75},{"type":"image","image":"71_i04","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":76},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_electric","volume":"1","channel":"elec","id":77},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":78},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_chainsaw_start","volume":"1","channel":"start","id":79},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":80},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":81},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_chainsaw","volume":"1","channel":"chao","id":82},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":83},{"type":"dialog","id":84},{"type":"charslot","id":85},{"type":"dialog","id":86},{"type":"charslot","id":87},{"type":"text","text":"跳起来——用盾斧击打地面，提供最初的动能，同时，让翔虫把自己拉到半空中，哈，发明这招的人真是个天才！","id":88},{"type":"dialog","id":89},{"type":"imagetween","yFrom":"0","yTo":"50","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.5","yScaleTo":"1.5","duration":"10","block":"false","id":90},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_shieldattack","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":93},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":94},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"chao","fadetime":"0.5","id":95},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"image","id":97},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":98},{"type":"effect","name":"$eb_daoguang_blue","x":"-4","y":"2","roz":"-140","layer":"1","id":99},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_bladeline_red","x":"-90.1","y":"-180.4","rox":"-40.2","roy":"145","roz":"96","layer":"1","id":100},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"60","ystrength":"60","vibrato":"60","randomness":"80","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":101},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_hit_slash_weapon03","volume":"1","id":102},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":103},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":104},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":106},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"70","ystrength":"70","vibrato":"70","randomness":"95","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":107},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_large","layer":"2","id":108},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_power1","id":109},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_burst","volume":"1","channel":"burst1","id":110},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":111},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":112},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_lighting","layer":"1","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":114},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_large","layer":"2","id":115},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_power1","id":116},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_burst","volume":"1","channel":"burst2","id":117},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":118},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":119},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":120},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"70","ystrength":"70","vibrato":"70","randomness":"95","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":123},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_large","layer":"2","id":124},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_power1","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_burst","volume":"1","channel":"burst3","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":127},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_smoke","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":129},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":130},{"type":"dialog","id":131},{"type":"charslot","id":132},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":133},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":135},{"type":"image","id":136},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":138},{"type":"dialog","id":139},{"type":"charslot","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"它不会又爬起来吧？！","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"放心，“异兽”彻底死了。","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"宝巫迦，你......","id":146},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":147,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾的身体没事了。吾能感觉到，刚才一直牵引着吾的某种东西消失了。","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"那究竟是什么？","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾......不知道。","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"不过，至少两位可以放心，吾等已经完成了对“异兽”的狩猎。接下来，吾会按照传统，将两位送回家乡。","id":155},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"charslot","id":157},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":159},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"恭喜陛下。","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"客套话就免了吧，月见夜。","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我是发自内心地为陛下和两位“异兽猎人”的胜利感到高兴。","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"既然你为吾等高兴，就该让吾去找“雷之主”。","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"这是两码事。","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"行了，听你说这些我就头疼。现在“异兽”也解决了，下一步我们该怎么回去？","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"接下来，请陛下净化“异兽”尸体，启动“御轮”，将两位“异兽猎人”送回去吧。","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"归还祭典呢？","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"陛下。","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这是传统。","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"祭典？","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这场祭典，既是为了感谢“御轮”的馈赠，也是为了告别“异兽猎人”。","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾等会将“异兽”的尸体运回，由吾通过仪式净化“异兽”的尸体。","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"而后，国民们会提取其中最有用的部位，制作成相应的武器或者道具送给“异兽猎人”作为纪念。","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"其余的部分，则或成为食材，或成为装饰，变成祭典的一部分。","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"而在祭典的最后，吾将启动“御轮”，将“异兽猎人”送回家乡。","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"月见夜，你要让两位“异兽猎人”以为吾国不知感恩吗？","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"......换作以往，听说“异兽”被狩猎，泡影国的人们或许会欢欣鼓舞。","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"但现在，“雷之主”的影响还未消去，不是举办祭典的时候。","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"就算是这样——","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"打住。","id":201},{"type":"dialog","id":202},{"type":"charslot","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#9$1","focus":"all","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"all","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜&宝巫迦","text":"梓兰小姐怎么看？","id":206},{"type":"charslot","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我们本来就急着回家，就算真的要举办祭典，我也未必有兴致。","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"泡影国的人们对我们已经付出了足够多的善意，我们也不需要你们再做些什么。","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"况且，月见夜说的也对，事急从权，就这样吧。","id":213},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"感谢你的理解，梓兰小姐。","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"不过，这样就可以了吗？","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......是的，这样就可以了。","id":219},{"type":"dialog","id":220},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":221},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":222},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"charslot","id":224},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":225},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":226},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":227},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":228},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":229},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice3","volume":"1","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"梓兰刚才问陛下的那句话是什么意思喵？","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐是问宝巫迦，她真的只狩猎“异兽”熔火蜗就可以了吗？","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"而宝巫迦做出了肯定的答复。","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"真奇怪喵，梓兰不是最想回去的人喵？为什么这个问题听起来像是，如果宝巫迦想要深究雷狼龙的问题，她会帮忙喵？","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"这不是自找麻烦喵？","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐就是这样的人。","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"嘴上说着不想管别人的麻烦，只想做好自己的事，结果不知不觉就会去插手别人的问题。","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"然后美其名曰——“不这么办还能怎么办？”","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"听起来真矛盾喵。","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐就是很矛盾喵。","id":249},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$6","focus":"m","id":250},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice3","volume":"1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"不要学我说话喵！","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"又在背后说我什么坏话呢？","id":254},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哪有，我在说梓兰姐是全天下最好的队长呢。","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我信你就见鬼了。","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"梓兰小姐，空爆小姐，既然事急从权，那吾便在此地进行仪式了。","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"好。","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"请退后一些。","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"她要做什么？","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"我知道了，宝巫迦又要跳舞了。","id":268},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，瞧着吧，这可能是我们最后一次看到了。","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"跳舞？","id":272},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"没错。","id":274},{"type":"dialog","id":275},{"type":"charslot","id":276},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":277},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":278},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":280},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_slbellbtl","volume":"1","id":281},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"10","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"以吾身为囚——","id":283},{"type":"dialog","id":284},{"type":"charslot","id":285},{"type":"text","text":"随着她的舞蹈，熔火蜗尸体上残留的黑气开始被牵引，缓慢而有序地被宝巫迦吸收。","id":286},{"type":"text","text":"她的脸色变得愈发苍白，但眼神却异常坚定。","id":287},{"type":"text","text":"黑气经过她的身体，似乎被某种力量“过滤”，最终化作纯净的无色能量，涌向她身后的“御轮”。","id":288},{"type":"text","text":"“御轮”的圆弧开始发出柔和的白光，光芒越来越亮，随后，一扇银白色的“门”出现在宝巫迦的身侧。","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"成功了！梓兰姐，快看！我们可以回家了！","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"空爆，等等！不对劲！","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"咦——","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"听吾之命——","id":297},{"type":"dialog","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":299},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_purifymagic","volume":"1","channel":"5","id":300},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_light","x":"-9","y":"-67","layer":"1","id":301},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"5","fadetime":"2.5","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":303},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magicchange","volume":"1","id":304},{"type":"bgeffect","duration":"3","id":305},{"type":"charslot","id":306},{"type":"text","text":"“御轮”的光芒在达到顶点的瞬间，毫无征兆地熄灭了。天地间仿佛被抽走了声音和色彩，陷入一片死寂。","id":307},{"type":"text","text":"纯白色的“门”眨眼间变成了黑色，紧接着，一股更加深沉的黑暗从这道“门”中喷涌而出。","id":308},{"type":"dialog","id":309},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snarl_1","volume":"1","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2105_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":311},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":312},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":313},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$plot_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_plot_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":314,"musicid":3},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"这家伙......长得像牙兽，但又根本不是牙兽......到底是怎么回事？！","id":315},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"咒鬼......为什么咒鬼会出现在这里？！","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"咒鬼？！","id":319},{"type":"dialog","id":320},{"type":"charslot","id":321},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","duration":"0.4","id":322},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_creek","volume":"1","id":323},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"月见夜，到底怎么回事？！","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"咒鬼是禁忌......","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"在泡影国的历史上，曾经发生过一次巨大的灾难，在那次灾难之中，被“诅咒”侵染的狼群毁灭了曾经的泡影国。","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"这些被“诅咒”侵染的狼，正是咒鬼。","id":331},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"从那次灾难中幸存下来的先祖们，在重新建立了泡影国之后，将周边的狼狩猎殆尽......","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"狼......你是说牙兽？","id":335},{"type":"dialog","id":336},{"type":"charslot","id":337},{"type":"dialog","id":338},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snarl_1","volume":"1","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2105_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2105_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":341},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":342},{"type":"charslot","id":343},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"宝巫迦，这门里还在不断往外涌出咒鬼，不能想想办法吗？！","id":345},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾做不到！","id":347},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"有什么东西在阻止它关上！","id":349},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这些咒鬼......它们的存在就预示着灾祸，难道是吾将它们召来——","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"别慌神，这不是你的错，宝巫迦！","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"没错，陛下，您的行动没有丝毫问题！一定是有其他东西——","id":355},{"type":"dialog","id":356},{"type":"charslot","id":357},{"type":"dialog","id":358},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_skillroar_hyper","volume":"1","id":359},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":360},{"type":"dialog","id":361},{"type":"text","text":"众人惊恐地抬头望去，只见远方的山崖之上，一头通体覆盖着青色鳞甲、周身缠绕着青白色雷电的巨兽，正昂首发出咆哮。","id":362},{"type":"text","text":"它站在高高的山崖上，睥睨正在发生的一切。","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"“雷之主”？！","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"这家伙，难道说是它影响了“御轮”？！","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"“雷之主”，难道是你......你一直都在等待着这一刻吗？","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"你之所以没有来干扰吾的狩猎，是因为你一直都在等待吾启动“御轮”的这一刻，是吗？！","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"回答吾！","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":374},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"回答吾——！！！！","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"陛下，不可莽撞！","id":378},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"“雷之主”正在破坏“试炼”！","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"难道就算这样你也要阻止吾吗，月见夜？！","id":382},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我——","id":384},{"type":"dialog","id":385},{"type":"charslot","id":386},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bigbell","volume":"3","id":387},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":388},{"type":"text","text":"突然，嘹亮且急促的钟声自远处的山脚下传来。","id":389},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"什么声音？！","id":391},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":392},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice2","volume":"1","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"这是警报喵！","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"这是狩猎团的紧急警报......平时是不会敲响这道警报的，除非——","id":396},{"type":"dialog","id":397},{"type":"charslot","id":398},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":399},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2111_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":400},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"将军，大事不好！","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2111_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"从“御轮”方向的雪山脚下和竹林中涌出了大量被“诅咒”侵染的野兽。","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2111_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"它们正在靠近都城！","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"传令下去，让狩猎团立刻组织防线，无论如何，不能让野兽们靠近都城！","id":408},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2111_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"将军您呢？我们需要您的指挥！","id":410},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我——我会立刻返回都城。","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2111_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"是！","id":414},{"type":"dialog","id":415},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":416},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":417},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"这家伙，不仅拦住了我们回家的路，还从门里召唤了兽群......但是，为什么它会——","id":420},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"管不了这些了，擒贼先擒王！","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"“雷之主”是这些野兽的首领对吧？宝巫迦，我们现在立刻杀到它面前，把它解决掉吧！","id":424},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾......","id":426},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"宝巫迦？","id":428},{"type":"dialog","id":429},{"type":"charslot","id":430},{"type":"text","text":"空爆走到宝巫迦身前拉住她，却发现她纹丝不动。","id":431},{"type":"text","text":"她这才看到宝巫迦的表情——","id":432},{"type":"text","text":"咬牙切齿，却又无可奈何。","id":433},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"空爆，别说傻话。","id":435},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你怎么保证自己杀到它面前之前，泡影国不会先被咒鬼们消灭？","id":437},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"但是从门里冒出的黑不溜秋的家伙根本没完没了啊！","id":439},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"趁现在解决它是最好的办法吧，谁知道它等会儿又会跑到哪里去！","id":441},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"别忘了，只有宝巫迦能够消除“诅咒”。","id":443},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"——啊啊啊啊，可恶！怎么这么麻烦！“雷之主”这个混蛋！","id":445},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"至少，在找到一个合适的方法前，我们不能拿泡影国的安危开玩笑。","id":447},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"可是——","id":449},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"“雷之主”就在那里！错过这个机会，下次不知道是什么时候了！","id":451},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"在过去，我阻止陛下狩猎“雷之主”，归根结底，是因为它尚未对我们露出獠牙。","id":453},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"然而，“雷之主”既然已经成为这次灾难的源头，陛下想要讨伐它，我也不好阻拦。","id":455},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"但是......","id":457},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"不用说了。","id":459},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"梓兰小姐说得对。","id":461},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾是一国之主，即使吾现在杀到它面前，泡影国若是在那之前毁灭，一切又有什么意义？","id":463},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"回城，准备应对兽潮。","id":465},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"陛下英明。","id":467},{"type":"dialog","id":468},{"type":"charslot","id":469},{"type":"text","text":"宝巫迦转身向都城走去。","id":470},{"type":"text","text":"转身前，她深深地看了一眼远处山头上的“雷之主”。","id":471},{"type":"text","text":"像是要将它的样子刻入灵魂之中。","id":472},{"type":"dialog","id":473},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":474},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":475},{"type":"bgeffect","id":476},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":477},{"type":"image","id":478},{"type":"charslot","id":479}],"characters":["宝巫迦","空爆","梓兰","月见夜","月见夜&宝巫迦","政宗","武士"]}